      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7901316",
      "subQuestName": "Return to the outside of the lake to check Wolfgang's notes",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790131601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790131601": {
            "id": "790131601",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What the... This guy's saying some pretty glib stuff, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131602"
            ]
          },
          "790131602": {
            "id": "790131602",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This is bad. We've got to get to Dragonspine and...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131605"
            ]
          },
          "790131605": {
            "id": "790131605",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah... Right, that's true. Wolfgang is only \"here\" at all because the Golden Apple Archipelago is under the effects of that device...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131606"
            ]
          },
          "790131606": {
            "id": "790131606",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's why Paimon thought that he was rescued... But in the end, he really was just stuck in that very first secret chamber, wasn't he...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131607"
            ]
          },
          "790131607": {
            "id": "790131607",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But still, this Wolfgang is really... annoying! We helped him so much, but he still thinks that it would be nice if he could \"pave the way\" for others...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131608"
            ]
          },
          "790131608": {
            "id": "790131608",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Couldn't he at least value his life a little more?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7901317",
      "subQuestName": "Check Wolfgang's notes",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7901325",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Paimon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790132601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790132601": {
            "id": "790132601",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, he didn't go in again. That's a relief.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790132602"
            ]
          },
          "790132602": {
            "id": "790132602",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, his annoyingly arrogant attitude is really ticking Paimon off!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790132603"
            ]
          },
          "790132603": {
            "id": "790132603",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "He really does sound like he's getting more and more full of himself...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790132604"
            ]
          },
          "790132604": {
            "id": "790132604",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That said, the highland ruins he mentioned should be near the submerged ruins...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790132605"
            ]
          },
          "790132605": {
            "id": "790132605",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's go have a look. Honestly, who knows if he was able to climb that high up safely..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7901318",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the now-sunken highland ruins",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790131801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790131801": {
            "id": "790131801",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Etchings",
            "text": "(These etchings are old. They have been written as such...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131802"
            ]
          },
          "790131802": {
            "id": "790131802",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Etchings",
            "text": "\"The wind is very strong here, so I'm not going to use a notebook.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131803"
            ]
          },
          "790131803": {
            "id": "790131803",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Etchings",
            "text": "\"The sunrise here is beautiful indeed. It fills my heart with satisfaction to have braved many dangers to get here.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131804"
            ]
          },
          "790131804": {
            "id": "790131804",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Etchings",
            "text": "\"I wonder if anyone will come after me to see these same sights.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131805"
            ]
          },
          "790131805": {
            "id": "790131805",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Etchings",
            "text": "\"Now that I've cleared this particular trial... Next stop, Dragonspine!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131806"
            ]
          },
          "790131806": {
            "id": "790131806",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Etchings",
            "text": "\"This truly is a lovely place. The only thing it's missing is some Sweet Madame...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131807"
            ]
          },
          "790131807": {
            "id": "790131807",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Etchings",
            "text": "\"Wolfgang.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7901327",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Paimon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790131901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790131901": {
            "id": "790131901",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh, so there weren't any notes here because he carved a message on the pillar. Huh, so he made it all the way here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131902"
            ]
          },
          "790131902": {
            "id": "790131902",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Where does his confidence come from, though... If we hadn't helped him out, he'd still be stuck in the secret chamber!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131903"
            ]
          },
          "790131903": {
            "id": "790131903",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He's pretty much gonna be Chilled Meat if he goes to Dragonspine!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131905",
              "790131907"
            ]
          },
          "790131905": {
            "id": "790131905",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh? U—Um, Paimon just means that he'd be in deep trouble if he went to Dragonspine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131908"
            ]
          },
          "790131908": {
            "id": "790131908",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We need to tell him not to go, and quick!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131909"
            ]
          },
          "790131909": {
            "id": "790131909",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, let's leave him another message, shall we...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131910"
            ]
          },
          "790131910": {
            "id": "790131910",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Right, that's right! Paimon thought so too... And y'know what, let's leave him some Sweet Madame this time too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131911"
            ]
          },
          "790131911": {
            "id": "790131911",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Maybe he'll start missing the warmth of Mondstadt once he's had a bite, and he'll give up on going to Dragonspine!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131912"
            ]
          },
          "790131912": {
            "id": "790131912",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The Sweet Madame's gonna spoil, you know.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790131913"
            ]
          },
          "790131913": {
            "id": "790131913",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh, come on, it's the thought that counts. Right?"
          },
          "790131907": {
            "id": "790131907",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Exactly! Dragonspine's super cold and is filled with hilichurls... Not to mention The Great Snowboar King!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7901328",
